  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Celebrating Six Year&apos;s of Supporting Bed-Stuy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On October 2016 Playground Coffee Shop opened its doors and in 2018 Playground Youth was created. Through the past six years we have made a commitment to serving our Bed-Stuy community.  As we look forward to the year ahead we are asking for monetary support to cover overhead costs and the upkeep of our change making initiatives. With your help we will be able to expand our impact by guaranteeing more healthy meals, literature, and a safe space to exchange knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
